[00:13.00]I live inside my own world of make believe
{"我活在自己虚构的世界里"}
[00:18.88]Kids screaming in their cradles, profanities
{"孩童在摇篮中尖叫着污言秽语"}
[00:24.87]I see the world through eyes covered in ink and bleach
{"透过被墨水与漂白剂蒙蔽的双眼看世界"}
[00:30.84]Cross out the ones who heard my cries and watched me weep
{"划掉那些听见我哭泣却冷眼旁观的人"}
[00:36.88]I love everything
{"我热爱万物"}
[00:39.88]Fire spreading all around my room
{"火焰在我的房间四处蔓延"}
[00:43.45]My world's so bright
{"我的世界如此耀眼"}
[00:45.07]It's hard to breathe but that's alright
{"呼吸艰难但没关系"}
